  "description": "Test 34 (the parts the core and its host see): CreateLot(5, 7, 3, 2, f) on an empty manager with zone grid (7, 7) = 1, (7, 8) = 2, (5, 8) = 3, (5, 7) = 4. The constructor's location is (x + w - 1, z), (x + w - 1, z + h - 1), (x, z + h - 1), (x, z) for facings 0..3, the size (w, h) or (h, w), the zone the zone grid's at the location; facing 7 gives location (0, 0), size (0, 0) and the zone of cell (0, 0). State 1 and reference count 2 after the call; GetLot(location, true) is the lot. CreateLot(10, 10, 0, 1, 0) keeps rect bytes {10, 10, 9, 10} and writes cell (10, 10) only (max(x + w - 1, x)).",
